<title>CHINA: China Communications Bank '96 profit up 1.46 pct.</title>
<headline>China Communications Bank '96 profit up 1.46 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Profits at the Communications Bank of China were 5.357 billion yuan ($645.42 million) in 1996, up by 1.46 percent from 1995, the Financial News said on Friday. It did not specify whether the figure was pre-tax.</p>
<p>At the end of 1996, the bank's deposits rose to 227.74 billion yuan, up by 24.8 percent compared with the end of 1995, it said.</p>
<p>Outstanding loans at the end of last year totalled 148.655 billion yuan, 22.7 percent up compared with the end of 1995, the newspaper said.</p>
<p>($1 = 8.3 yuan)</p>
<p>-- Beijing Newsroom (8610) 6532 1921</p>
